1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me
to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 8=

15
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:01,240
He's injured internally.

16
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,320
He passed out.

17
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:03,030
He...

18
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:04,920
He actually got knocked out
by Zhao Feiyang.

19
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:06,950
T-That's terrifying.

20
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:08,150
How did Zhao Feiyang do it?

21
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,000
He... There's no way he could.

22
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:11,280
But we all saw it happen.

23
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,950
Who else could it be but Zhao Feiyang?

24
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,480
Senior Brother Wang was overconfident.

25
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:15,710
He only used 30 percent
of his strength.

26
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,590
That's why he lost so badly.

27
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:18,790
Deng.

28
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:22,000
Was Wang Jie's overconfidence
really to blame?

29
00:01:22,070 --> 00:01:23,200
It seems not.

30
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:24,920
Although Zhao Feiyang's

31
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:27,150
cultivation is lower than Wang Jie's,

32
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:29,920
his Mountain-Shifting Palm
has reached full mastery.

33
00:01:30,310 --> 00:01:32,950
Wang Jie had only reached
minor mastery.

34
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,280
No wonder he lost.

35
00:01:35,510 --> 00:01:37,760
He didn't waste those three years.

36
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:41,230
It takes 30 years
to fully master that palm.

37
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,510
He did it in just a few years.

38
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:44,680
What a shame.

39
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:47,350
He missed the best age to train.

40
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:49,430
And his Dao Bone grade is too low.

41
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,120
Otherwise, he might

42
00:01:51,310 --> 00:01:54,200
be an exceptional genius
second only to Cuihua.

43
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:55,430
Zhao Feiyang.

44
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,310
The Sect Master ordered a spar.

45
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,920
Yet you hurt a fellow disciple.

46
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,040
Ridiculous.

47
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,070
In that situation,

48
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,350
if I hadn't gone all out,

49
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,680
I would have been the one down.

50
00:02:04,870 --> 00:02:06,150
Yet you accuse me of harming him.

51
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,240
Is defending myself wrong now?

52
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:08,840
You...

53
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,680
Enough.

54
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,430
Accidents happen in a fight.

55
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,520
Take Wang Jie away to rest.

56
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,150
Zhao Feiyang.

57
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,840
From this day on,

58
00:02:21,430 --> 00:02:23,840
you are a formal disciple
of the Heavenly Sword Sect.

59
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,030
That is only fair.

60
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,630
Thank you, Sect Master.

61
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,520
Now that I'm a formal disciple,

62
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,840
may I enter the Alchemy Hall?

63
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:33,190
I need the alchemy fire
to repair my damaged meridians.

64
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,360
Well...

65
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,560
The alchemy fire may help,

66
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,080
but the fire poison is no small threat.

67
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,840
Are you certain?

68
00:02:40,190 --> 00:02:40,680
I am.

69
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,960
I've placed the Alchemy Hall's sigil
on you.

70
00:03:03,150 --> 00:03:04,240
You may enter.

71
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,400
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
All right.

72
00:03:08,190 --> 00:03:09,360
Come, my girl.

73
00:03:09,590 --> 00:03:10,310
Let's have a talk.

74
00:03:21,190 --> 00:03:21,710
My girl.

75
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:24,280
(Heavenly Sword Sect)
How old are you?

76
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,520
Sect Mas...

77
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:28,150
Father, I'm 18.

78
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,680
A fine age

79
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,870
to enter the martial path.

80
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,030
Wonderful.

81
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,910
The younger you are
when your talent awakens,

82
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,000
the brighter your future.

83
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:41,800
Here's what we'll do, Cuihua.

84
00:03:42,470 --> 00:03:43,590
No need to choose.

85
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,030
(The Mystic Origin Art?)

86
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,150
Deng.

87
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:58,310
You've kept this for centuries, huh?

88
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,800
I still don't think it's good enough.

89
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,280
It's only an earth-tier cultivation art.

90
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,590
Even so,

91
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:07,710
it's the best I can offer.

92
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,800
You are too modest, Elder Deng.

93
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:11,360
Heaven, Earth, Mystic, Yellow, Mortal.

94
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:14,190
Earth-tier cultivation arts
rank just below heaven-tier ones.

95
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:16,240
Across the Shenwu Continent,

96
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,560
only three heaven-tier
cultivation arts exist.

97
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:21,120
There are 12 earth-tier
cultivation arts.

98
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,120
There should also be

99
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,160
a sacred-tier cultivation art
above the heaven tier.

100
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:27,480
You mean the Nine Heavens Codex?

101
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,750
It has been lost for ages.

102
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:32,040
We don't even know if it exists.

103
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:34,190
The Nine Heavens Codex.

104
00:04:34,310 --> 00:04:35,120
Good heavens.

105
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:36,800
Then forget about it.

106
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:38,480
Cuihua.

107
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,190
My Mystic Origin Art

108
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,800
isn't as powerful as a heaven-tier art,

109
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,120
but with your talent,

110
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:45,160
if you master it completely

111
00:04:45,430 --> 00:04:47,630
and pair it with your
divine-grade Dao Bone,

112
00:04:47,750 --> 00:04:48,360
one day,

113
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,480
it may become
a heaven-tier cultivation art.

114
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,270
It is entirely possible.

115
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:53,600
Here.

116
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,070
Thank you, Elder Deng.

117
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:06,630
I already have a cultivation art.

118
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,680
Where did you get one?

119
00:05:09,070 --> 00:05:09,950
It was...

120
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,070
Zhao Feiyang taught it to me.

121
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,160
It's called the Primordial Dao Art.

122
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,120
The Primordial Dao Art?

123
00:05:17,270 --> 00:05:19,240
That's the lowest-tier
cultivation art.

124
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,270
Oh, dear.

125
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,120
Oh, what a shame.

126
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,510
I was only a servant disciple

127
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,070
with no one to support me.

128
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,160
Only Zhao Feiyang
was willing to teach me.

129
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,510
Never mind.

130
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,800
A weaker art is no concern.

131
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,070
I'll use rare treasures

132
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:36,270
to make up the difference.

133
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:39,560
Cuihua.

134
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,560
Snow Ward?

135
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,390
Wang.

136
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,240
How did this sword end up with you?

137
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,430
It belonged to one
of the Three Sword Immortals,

138
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,390
the Canglan Sword Immortal.

139
00:06:05,950 --> 00:06:07,480
A trace of sword intent remains.

140
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,240
I hope it helps you.

141
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,830
Thank you, Elder Wang.

142
00:06:31,510 --> 00:06:32,120
Cuihua.

143
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,070
This is
a Meridian and Marrow Cleansing Pill.

144
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:36,560
I need not explain what it does.

145
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,070
Take it.

146
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,630
Thank you, Elder Murong.

147
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:54,510
I'm afraid this is exactly
what I need most.

148
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,560
My goddaughter

149
00:06:57,830 --> 00:06:59,480
is truly a treasure to our sect.

150
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:02,070
You three have made me so proud.

151
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:04,800
Girl.

152
00:07:05,430 --> 00:07:06,390
What will you do next?

153
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,600
Train your art first, or...

154
00:07:10,310 --> 00:07:10,920
Don't worry.

155
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:13,720
I'll teach you myself.

156
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:14,870
Father.

157
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,190
Before I begin training,

158
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:18,720
I want to enter
the Alchemy Hall

159
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,070
and use the alchemy fire

160
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:22,310
to refine Elder Murong's
Meridian and Marrow Cleansing Pill.

161
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:25,950
(I will bid my old self)

162
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,720
(farewell for good.)

163
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,630
Fire poison is dangerous.

164
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,240
But you have a divine-grade Dao Bone

165
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:34,680
and Snow Ward to protect you.

166
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,360
You should be able to keep
the fire poison under control.

167
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:38,950
Good.

168
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:43,560
Then cleanse your meridians
and marrow there.

169
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,720
When you return,

170
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,270
the entire Shenwu Continent

171
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:48,430
will be the stage for your rise.

172
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,480
What happened to me?

173
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:12,430
You don't remember?

174
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,070
I remember making
Zhao Feiyang spit blood.

175
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,000
Then...

176
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:21,830
I recall nothing else.

177
00:08:22,190 --> 00:08:23,720
Then he knocked you out
with a single palm strike.

178
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:24,630
What?

179
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:27,270
H-How could he knock me out?

180
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,800
Everyone in the sect saw it.

181
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,270
(Impossible.)

182
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:34,840
(I used all my strength.)

183
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:37,200
(He knocked me out
with a single palm strike?)

184
00:08:37,910 --> 00:08:38,440
(Could it...)

185
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,080
(Could those trips to pleasure houses)

186
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,240
(have weakened me?)

187
00:08:46,270 --> 00:08:47,200
I was careless.

188
00:08:47,910 --> 00:08:48,440
Where is he?

189
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:49,750
I'll get my revenge.

190
00:08:50,750 --> 00:08:51,750
He's in the Alchemy Hall.

191
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:53,480
He plans to cleanse
his meridians and marrow.

192
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:54,630
If he succeeds,

193
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:55,910
his cultivation might rise again.

194
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:57,840
Then our days in this sect

195
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,670
will only get harder.

196
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:00,960
We're done.

197
00:09:01,390 --> 00:09:02,790
He's making a comeback.

198
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:03,870
Then...

199
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:05,360
What do we do?

200
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,320
It's come to this.

201
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:08,670
Nothing can be done.

202
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:14,000
Right.

203
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,030
Junior Brother.

204
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:17,320
During my year
in Myriad Beasts Valley,

205
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:19,320
I killed a fire spirit

206
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,030
and took its inner core.

207
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:24,480
It's yours.

208
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,440
A fire spirit's inner core

209
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,200
contains extremely potent fire poison.

210
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,870
It's useless to me, Senior Brother Lin.

211
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,200
Are you sure it's useless?

212
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,670
I think you'll find a use for it.

213
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,670
Keep it.

214
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,840
But...

215
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:51,360
Senior Brother Wang.

216
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:55,270
This fire spirit's inner core
contains a large amount of fire poison.

217
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:57,670
The Alchemy Hall has fire poison too.

218
00:09:58,150 --> 00:10:00,030
If we throw it

219
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,600
into the Alchemy Hall,

220
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:07,200
Zhao Feiyang won't make it out alive.

221
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:11,790
(Zhao Feiyang and Cuihua
are both inside.)

222
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,510
(Once they're dead,)

223
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,840
(I will surely become
the sect's chief disciple.)

224
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,750
(I'll get priority
for all the sect's resources.)

225
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,900
(Spirit Awakening Realm, Stage 1)

226
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:02,390
(My internal wounds
are finally healed.)

227
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,720
(Many impurities in my body are gone.)

228
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,000
(Next,)

229
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,750
(As long as
I fully restore my meridians,)

230
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:09,600
(returning to my former peak)

231
00:11:09,870 --> 00:11:10,670
(will be easy.)

232
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:22,030
(Good.)

233
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:23,840
(It seems Cuihua can withstand
the fire poison.)

234
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,200
(Once we leave,)

235
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,240
(I'll congratulate her.)

236
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,240
Why are the flames
so violent today?

237
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:45,240
Oh, no.

238
00:11:54,270 --> 00:11:55,320
No one saw us, right?

239
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:56,360
No one did.

240
00:11:56,630 --> 00:11:57,750
We were very discreet.

241
00:11:59,030 --> 00:12:00,120
That wretched Zhao Feiyang

242
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:01,960
humiliated me in front of everyone.

243
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:04,030
Now he's as good as dead.

244
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:04,720
Let's go. Hurry!

245
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,030
(Why is this happening?)

246
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,000
(Why is the fire poison so fierce?)

247
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:28,390
(Am I really in danger today?)

248
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,080
(No.)

249
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,750
(I won't let him look down on me.)

250
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,120
(I must hold on.)

251
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:10,550
Cuihua.

252
00:13:10,910 --> 00:13:11,320
Cuihua.

253
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:14,790
The Alchemy Hall stays sealed

254
00:13:15,030 --> 00:13:17,320
for 49 days at a time.

255
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,720
But only ten days have passed.

256
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,030
Surviving alone

257
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,080
is already difficult.

258
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,550
If I help Cuihua too,

259
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:27,390
neither of us may survive.

260
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,670
I can't die here.

261
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:40,120
Here, eat.

262
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:41,200
Senior Brother Zhao.

263
00:13:43,390 --> 00:13:44,270
I made it myself.

264
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,240
This is for you.

265
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,840
It smells wonderful.

266
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,750
Please take it.

267
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,480
As the sect's chief disciple,
Senior Brother Zhao

268
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:56,120
made countless contributions

269
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:58,200
and helped our sect become one of the

270
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,440
top three sects in the Southern Domain
of the Shenwu Continent.

271
00:14:00,750 --> 00:14:02,000
Now that he's down on his luck,

272
00:14:02,870 --> 00:14:04,120
we turn our backs on him.

273
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:06,000
Isn't that too cruel?

274
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:10,240
For the past three years,

275
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,600
only she treated me as a friend.

276
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,120
If I let her die in the Alchemy Hall,

277
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,550
wouldn't that make me utterly heartless?

278
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:33,790
To save her,

279
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:36,480
I must absorb all the fire poison.

280
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,240
Can I withstand it?

281
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:42,320
(Bai.)

282
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:44,720
(Is this the Dao Bone
you left me?)

283
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:47,550
(I hope we meet again.)

284
00:14:56,390 --> 00:14:57,150
Come to me. All of it.

285
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:56,260
(Myriad Demon Hall
Sacred Training Ground)

286
00:15:58,750 --> 00:15:59,550
(Impossible.)

287
00:16:02,270 --> 00:16:03,720
As expected of the man I chose.

288
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:05,550
In just two months,

289
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,750
he refined my sacred-grade Dao Bone

290
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,150
and gained full control.

291
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:11,390
It seems

292
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:13,480
we'll meet again very soon.

293
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:20,850
♪I once stood on high, drawing
spiritual energy into my blade♪

294
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:23,250
♪I laughed, pointing at
the stars, young and fearless♪

295
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:27,370
♪Then came my fall, with frost
and snow on my shoulders♪

296
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:31,930
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

297
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:35,250
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

298
00:16:36,090 --> 00:16:38,760
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

299
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:42,380
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

300
00:16:42,460 --> 00:16:46,190
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

301
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:50,230
♪I seek the Dao
beyond the clouds♪

302
00:16:50,500 --> 00:16:53,620
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

303
00:16:54,420 --> 00:16:56,940
♪With this flesh and soul♪

304
00:16:57,260 --> 00:17:00,490
♪I shall forge a new age♪

305
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:03,570
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

306
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:07,030
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

307
00:17:07,250 --> 00:17:09,890
♪At cultivation's peak♪

308
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:13,250
♪My first resolve
remains unchanged♪

309
00:17:14,020 --> 00:17:16,730
♪The sun and moon turn♪

310
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:20,250
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

311
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:27,230
♪I am the undying flame♪

312
00:17:28,220 --> 00:17:32,890
♪Looking back
when dust settles♪

313
00:17:33,150 --> 00:17:36,250
♪At last I see, immortality♪

314
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:41,390
♪Lives in your smiles♪
